.ipynb_checkpoints
*/.ipynb_checkpoints/*

# Raw per-timestep prediction/ground-truth dumps are large (tens of MB per
# model/period, much of it duplicated across models) and not practical to
# version-control; aggregate metrics (results_table.json,
# per_station_results.json, timing.json, <model>_long_term.json) capture
# everything needed for the paper-vs-reproduction comparison. Checkpoints
# and training logs ARE kept in git (small, and directly useful).
dst_transitnet/outputs/*.npy

# TSB-Forecast-base reproduction: same pattern as dst_transitnet -- large
# per-timestep artifacts and in-progress run outputs are not committed;
# aggregate metrics/checkpoints from a completed run are added explicitly.
tsb_forecast/outputs/*.npy

# APC tabular reproduction (Yusuf et al. 2025 stop-level framework, adapted)
apc_tabular/outputs/*.npy
apc_tabular/logs/full_run.log
apc_tabular/logs/dnn_only.log
catboost_info/
